      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While I don't have personal experience with maintenance reports, I can tell you that stories like that are not uncommon in the world of building maintenance. People often attribute strange noises, drafts, or malfunctions to things they can't immediately explain, and sometimes those explanations drift into the realm of the unusual. It's a classic human tendency to find a narrative, even a fantastical one, for inexplicable glitches. These reports are usually investigated by looking at common culprits like rodents, pests, or HVAC system wear and tear.",
      "source": "target",
